Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:27.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD973F0&\4c&HBB9ECA&}说罢我炫耀给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:30.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD973F0&\4c&HBB9ECA&}连连称赞的你其实
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:34.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD973F0&\4c&HBB9ECA&}早就有了这个东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:39.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EB4F1&\4c&HDA83ED&}什么！事到如今就
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.55,0:22:42.59,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EB4F1&\4c&HDA83ED&}别再旧事重提了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:45.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EB4F1&\4c&HDA83ED&}这光彩夺目的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:50.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EB4F1&\4c&HDA83ED&}我一刻也不愿失去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C24&\4c&HBBD06D&}你到底在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.85,0:22:56.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C24&\4c&HBBD06D&}偏偏是在这种日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.86,0:23:00.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C24&\4c&HBBD06D&}我才需要一个能够
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:06.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C24&\4c&HBBD06D&}鼓励我前行的你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:11.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBA9E1&\shad0}啊这份庞大的思恋
